Rule 17 (When groups > 1, the number of output channels should be divisible by groups)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int} |= if v_2 > 1 then shape(v_1, 0) / v_2 = shape(v_1, 0) / v_2
>>
Rule 18 (When groups > 1, the number of output channels should be divisible by groups and input channel divided by groups equals an integer)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int} |= if v_2 > 1 then (shape(v_1, 0) / v_2 = shape(v_1, 0) / v_2) ∧ (shape(v_1, 1) / v_2 = shape(v_1, 1) / v_2)
>>
Rule 19 (When groups > 1, the number of output channels should be divisible by groups and input channel divided by groups equals an integer and weight first shape equals output divided by group)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor, v_3 : int} |= if v_3 > 1 then (shape(v_1, 0) / v_3 = shape(v_1, 0) / v_3) ∧ (shape(v_1, 1) / v_3 = shape(v_1, 1) / v_3) ∧ (shape(v_2, 0) = shape(v_1, 0) / v_3)
